{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Steam version of \u300aStarward\u300b is an Asian server version, and the account is not compatible with other servers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STARWARD collaborates with BLAZBLUE: ENTROPY EFFECT, with the crossover character Reki making her debut! Brand-new skins for Shadow and Rhine will be available, seasonal winter and Lunar New Year events are underway, and new characters Aisling, Dragoner, Krista, and Nameless will join the roster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starward is a 3D fighting game that integrates mecha girls and classic GVG combat gameplay, with 1V1 and 2V2 mode as the core gameplay. In Starward, players can control mecha girls with distinct personalities and different combat styles, and experience three-dimensional combat experiences beyond the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.poster.avif?t=1772790107\" width=1170 height=836 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.webm?t=1772790107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/eb04527d8955f4de78bbe6ee689cd0f5.mp4?t=1772790107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/af3bfca461b4706e9b285ff5326452ca.poster.avif?t=1772790107\" width=1170 height=836 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764370/extras/af3bfca461b4706e9b285ff5326452ca.webm?t=1772790107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><